From 5c90202eb30aba6348ebdacd1e64f7fabdf15f97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZKTeco <lifaet@zkteco.local>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:58:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: dashboard vs daily split + flag +-5 single + settings
 menu + hide analytics

- Flag: single status from first punch only with +-5 min grace around office_start (on time within +-5, late >+5, early <-5, absent), no late_early dual, update AttendanceController and AnalyticsController lateTrend, frontend badge single, row-late only for late, settings modal text +-5
- Dashboard vs Daily split: sidebar Dashboard (dashboard, speedometer) + Daily (daily, calendar) as separate, filter-type Dashboard/Daily, dashboardSection (summaryCards+dashboardCharts) vs attendanceSection (table), updateFilters shows date for dashboard+daily, prev/next for dashboard, hide copy/export/colvis/add for dashboard, show for daily, dashboardCharts only for dashboard (loadDashboardCharts checks dashboard), summary for dashboard via separate /api/attendance-summary fetch
- Settings: separate sidebar Settings (gear) opens settingsModal (weekend/holidays/office hours), keep gear button also, remove analytics link (dashboard already has charts), attendance2/analytics sidebars updated to Dashboard+Daily
- Default view dashboard (hash fallback dashboard, applyView excludes dashboard from table reload, initial currentType dashboard)
